# Plain text: source, config, data and descriptors stay out of LFS.
*.h text
*.hpp text
*.cpp text
*.inl text
*.cs text
*.ini text
*.csv text
*.json text
*.md text
*.py text
*.uplugin text
*.uproject text

# Binary assets and media: Git LFS.
